This is hopeless. 
I don't understand any of this.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.030
You're teasing me again.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:47.660
Why can't you stop
 playing around like a child,

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:50.580
