00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:54.370
Yes?

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:57.970
Say, how's that homework coming along?{Hey, are you trying your best...? On your homework? // yes, because "ganbaru" simply must equal "try/do one's best" every time it appears...}

