What can I say? I'm a student.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.430
Do you still have a lot left?

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.760
Yeah, you could say that.

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:15.430
Isn't this by Richard Mills?

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.980
