00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:23.950
By the way, weren't you aiming to become a cameraman yourself?

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.430
You like his work?

00:06:25.430 --> 00:06:28.780
Not really. My dad knows him and stuff, so...

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:30.410
