I still remember going to the bath house
 with the Kagura kids {note: I changed this rendition of "Yuuji-kun-tachi for space/time limitations}

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.530
ten years ago,
 after we saw some fireworks.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:52.490
