00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:58.150
I remember that, as well as the scolding we got from our parents afterward.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:59.750
Really?

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:05.710
Yeah, and do you still remember how Marie-chan burst out crying?

