No way...

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:49.930
There isn't much point looking for them now.

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:53.620
And, I left my cell phone 
in my overcoat pocket.

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:54.840
Sensei...

00:08:54.840 --> 00:09:00.350
It'll be fine. We're all going to the same place, 
 so we'll meet up eventually.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:02.680
I-I guess you're right.

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:07.480
{Then, }Let's go visit the stands 
before the fireworks display starts.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.890
We might run into the others, too.

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:10.970
Okay.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:16.450
This seems hopeless. {rw?}

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:33.340
<i>On some level...</i>

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.450
<i>Kogorou-sensei...</i>

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.760
<i>...looks the way Yuuji used to look.{...looks like the childhood Yuuji. }</i>

