For purposes of scooping goldfish, 
 this tool is inherently flawed.

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:10.130
Oh wow, young lady, 
you sure are skilled at this!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.300
I'm not <i>that</i>  skilled.{sb?}

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.230
Incredible!

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:21.640
Just how did she manage 
to scoop the fish with this...?

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.160
Here, just take it out of 5,000,000 yen.

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.570
Oh, everybody's a comedian...

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:39.650
Jeez, where did Kazuki run off to?

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.150
Yuu-chin~

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:45.870
Did I surprise you?

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.350
Chihaya-chan...

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:49.380
You want some takoyaki?

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:51.380
No thanks, I'm good.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:52.570
Oh, are you?

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:56.060
So, have you found Kazuki?

