00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:02.480
Where did she go? The fireworks display 
is gonna start soon.

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.310
Uh, you know...

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:07.390
I overheard Machida 
and Serizawa talking...

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:11.400
...about how Kazuki had some 
unforgettable person. Who was that?

