Ah, Yuu-chin,
 did they pique your curiosity?{Ryo: Yuu-chin, I see that you are concerned about that matter. // brevity is the soul of wit, and of concise, easily-readable subtitles}

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.220
Uh... not exactly.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.400
That "somebody" might be pretty close by. 
 It's more likely than you think.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:24.440
That "somebody" might be pretty close by. 
 It's more likely than you think.

