It's really beautiful...

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:44.190
Ka... Kazuki!

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:47.470
Yu... Yuuji!

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:11.080
It seems that they haven't arrived yet. {contrary to popular opinion, forms of the verb "kuru" do not always have to be rendered with "come," e.g. "kuru na! = "don't come!"}

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.700
Sheesh, where did that darned Yuuji go?

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.960
Well, they've still got time to get here
 before the fireworks start.

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:19.780
Even so...

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:23.560
You sure do worry about Kagura-kun a lot.

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:25.070
You really do like him, don't you?

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.470
T-That's not it! {sb?}

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:31.930
Granted, I did like having Yuuji 
as a playmate when we were kids.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:39.160
But now, he always complains 
about how I'm sooo unkind and unfair,

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:41.650
while he completely "forgets" 
about his misdeeds. 

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:43.110
What kind of misdeeds? {Bad deeds as in?}

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:43.580
What kind of misdeeds? {line was too short-timed, had to allow scene-bleed}

00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:48.120
Like... uh...  the perverted kind...?

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.620
But that's perfectly normal
 for all adolescent boys.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.160
He's perfectly <i>ab</i>-normal!

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:54.750
He's perfectly <i>ab</i>-normal!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.260
It's not like I want him
 to be a child again or anything.

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:02.080
He's just become so twisted and bizarre now. {He's more of a sex machine now than a man, twisted and evil.}

