Let's sit down for a while.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:08.650
I was thinking...

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:12.600
...that Kagura-kun hasn't changed
 very much, if at all.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.040
From my point of view,{s}

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:19.650
he's still the same boy you spoke so highly of back in middle school.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.780
The Yuuji I talked about...?

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:28.180
Could this boy be your first love, Kazuki-chan?

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:31.040
Ehh? I wouldn't say he's my first love...

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:34.580
He's just a neighbor boy 
who always played with us. {Ryo: "He is just a neighbor that always plays with us." // Um, verb tense shift, anyone? It makes it sound like he was still around at the time.}

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.710
I do like him, but as a friend.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:38.960
Really?

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:43.960
He was always dragging me all over the place.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.890
No, no, no...

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:49.010
When he'd see me playing with others, 
 he'd always force his way into the game.

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:52.970
And whenever we ate together, 
he'd always steal my side dishes.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:56.480
Like I said, he was a pain in the butt.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:14:00.740
Judging by the wistful {Ryo:wishful}look on your face, 
 I'd say you liked him quite a bit.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:05.680
Why would you still be carrying
 his picture around if you didn't like him?

00:14:05.680 --> 00:14:06.540
She's right.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:08.760
N-No, you're both wrong!

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:10.950
Dang it, Chihaya!

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:15.450
It's normal for appearances to change as we grow.

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:22.170
But some things never change,
 like the way he competes for your attention...

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.960
...and how he's utterly crazy about you.

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:31.310
A lot of boys, once they hit puberty, 
 get a little <i>too</i>  interested in girls.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:36.230
Still, he's not trying to be mean 
when he hits on you.{Ryo: But his meddling to you are not exactly evil.//lolwut }

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.900
Well, he's not "not trying" hard enough!{original rewrite: Even if they aren't evil,
 I won't stand for them! // IIRC Ryomi had "Even if they aren't evil, I won't forgive him!" here. // I felt like doing something different with the line ~Zalis}

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:44.440
Deep down, Yuuji enjoys doing cruel things 
just to get a rise out of me.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:48.030
Hmm, I wonder about that.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.950
There's no doubt in <i>my</i>  mind.

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:55.950
The festival is about to start. Shall we go join the others?

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.810
Just take it out of 5,000,000 yen.

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:58.710
Oh, everybody's a comedian...{stc} {Ryo: Thanks and please come again. // <- yes, Ryo's line is correct here, but I chose to rewrite it to compensate for not using a TL note to explain the joke}

00:14:58.710 --> 00:14:58.960
Oh, everybody's a comedian...

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:02.710
Jeez, where did Kazuki run off to?

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:07.680
Kazuki-chan, watch your step.

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:08.760
Ah, yes.

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:13.350
<i>I really wish Yuuji had turned out
 like Kogorou-sensei...</i>

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:23.740
Ka... Kazuki!

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:26.480
Yu... Yuuji!

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:37.700
Yuuji...

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:43.520
Yuu-chin?

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.960
W-Wait...

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:46.840
Oh?

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.010
We've found Onii-chan and everybody else.

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.750
I wouldn't want to interrupt...

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.350
Interrupt? Interrupt what?{Ryo: What are you referring to with "interrupting"? // too long for the line's time, and just not plausible high-schooler dialogue?}

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:56.480
Don't try to hide it.
 Chihaya-chan told me everything.

00:15:56.890 --> 00:16:00.870
Your unforgettable person is that teacher over there, right?

00:16:02.300 --> 00:16:04.230
Yuuji... Ah!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.950
Ouch...

